<title>FRANCE: Rouen Feb 1-26 grain exports 483,397 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Feb 1-26 grain exports 483,397 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 483,397 tonnes between February 1 and February 26, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 484,000 tonnes for the whole of February 1996.</p>
<p>The 483,397 tonnes grain total included 457,147 tonnes of wheat and 26,250 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   32,660</p>
<p>    Egypt			   10,000</p>
<p>    Spain			    3,250</p>
<p>    Britain			 14,472</p>
<p>    Greece			  13,350</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,500</p>
<p>    Italy			  162,005</p>
<p>    Morocco			106,550</p>
<p>    Poland			  13,000</p>
</text>
